{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちは。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"けやき坂46の井口眞緒です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH52CECVBQGV85F8NRCSFAF","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"結構前にねるちゃんと撮った写真。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ねるちゃん可愛い。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH52DH7QEE1RQ1GRVDYAD3P","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近、トマトジュースとアイスカフェラテにはまってます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"足の虫刺されが痒いです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"友達と行動時間帯が合わなくて悲しいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"18歳に戻りたいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大学1年生からもう1回やりたいよー。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最後まで読んでくれてありがとうございます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いぐちまお"}],"source":"archive"}